# box  centre x y z  size x y z  qx qy qz qw
# Measured off hod_jib.obj by connected part (LHM-77). The mast leans, so its box is the
# bounds of both timbers; the arm is the hoist boom and the basket, not the empty air
# between them, which the old single arm box wrapped.
# footing and buttress feet
box 0.000 0.060 0.140 1.400 0.380 0.680 0 0 0 1
# mast, both timbers
box -0.040 1.400 0.000 0.380 2.400 0.400 0 0 0 1
# platform deck
box -0.030 1.620 0.000 1.260 0.100 1.220 0 0 0 1
# hoist boom
box -0.550 2.390 0.000 1.340 0.380 0.160 0 0 0 1
# basket on its cord
box -1.180 1.140 0.000 0.500 0.340 0.500 0 0 0 1
# the nest cage
box -0.055 2.810 0.000 1.020 0.920 1.000 0 0 0 1
